('advanced-native-2085', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-2085-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["They helped the actors regain composure while the group considered its next step."],"options":["They helped the actors regain composure while the group considered its next step.","They confirmed a replacement venue before the group discussed its worries.","They made the decision for the actors without discussing the worries.","They encouraged the actors to give up the show before discussing any alternatives."]},"advanced-native-2085-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Talking together helped them face the setback without implying that the venue problem was settled.","They helped the actors keep their balance when the water got rough by talking through their worries.","They offered a steadying conversation before the group chose its next step.","The actors had support with their worries while retaining the decision about the show."],"options":["Talking together helped them face the setback without implying that the venue problem was settled.","They helped the actors keep their balance when the water got rough by talking through their worries.","They offered a steadying conversation before the group chose its next step.","The actors had support with their worries while retaining the decision about the show."]},"advanced-native-2085-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["This account describes physical balance on a boat, rather than establishing the figurative meaning of keeping your balance when the water gets rough."],"options":["The friend is described as discussing the character’s worries about a cancelled show.","This account describes physical balance on a boat, rather than establishing the figurative meaning of keeping your balance when the water gets rough.","The lesson on footing establishes that the character has recovered emotionally from a setback."]},"advanced-native-2085-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The practical difficulty has already disappeared.