('advanced-native-2102', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-2102-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["She wanted room to try her ideas while still receiving useful feedback."],"options":["She found the requirement helpful because it encouraged different designs.","She had already received permission to replace the example with her own plan.","She wanted room to try her ideas while still receiving useful feedback.","She wanted to stop receiving any teaching or comments."]},"advanced-native-2102-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The rule left no room for her to try a different design.","She wanted creative feedback but had to copy the model each time.","The constraint concerned her ability to explore rather than the existence of teaching itself.","She felt stifled because every sketch had to follow the example rather than explore her own idea."],"options":["The rule left no room for her to try a different design.","She wanted creative feedback but had to copy the model each time.","The constraint concerned her ability to explore rather than the existence of teaching itself.","She felt stifled because every sketch had to follow the example rather than explore her own idea."]},"advanced-native-2102-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["A question alone does not establish that she feels stifled; her account describes useful clarification and room to choose."],"options":["A question alone does not establish that she feels stifled; her account describes useful clarification and room to choose.","Her account says the tutor prevented her from choosing a design.","The question proves that she wanted the tutor to stop giving any feedback."]},"advanced-native-2102-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The rule-maker intentionally wants to harm the speaker."],"options":["The speaker experiences the rules as restrictive.","The rule-maker intentionally wants to harm the speaker.","More context can identify which restrictions are involved."]},"advanced-native-2102-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["She can feel stifled by copying every example and still want to learn; she is asking for room to test an idea and receive feedback on it."],"options":["I would count any request for a different design as a refusal to learn from the tutor.","I thought wanting feedback meant she was comfortable with copying every sketch.","She can feel stifled by copying every example and still want to learn; she is asking for room to test an idea and receive feedback on it."]},"advanced-native-2102-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I feel stifled when we return to the standard answer before I can explain my reading. Could I have two minutes next time to show the lines behind my interpretation, followed by others’ responses?","I have felt stifled by being interrupted, but I am not asking everyone to accept my interpretation. Could we let each speaker finish a brief explanation of the text before discussing disagreements?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-2103', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-2103-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Shared equipment costs helped, while overlapping evening preferences needed resolving."],"options":["The groups decided that sharing had no financial benefit.","Shared equipment costs helped, while overlapping evening preferences needed resolving.","The groups had already resolved the timetable before buying any equipment.","The better equipment removed the need to discuss room access."]},"advanced-native-2103-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It was a blessing and a challenge, with better equipment but a timetable to negotiate.","They gained affordable equipment while facing competing time preferences.","The financial benefit came with a practical scheduling problem.","They valued sharing but still needed an agreement about evenings."],"options":["It was a blessing and a challenge, with better equipment but a timetable to negotiate.","They gained affordable equipment while facing competing time preferences.","The financial benefit came with a practical scheduling problem.","They valued sharing but still needed an agreement about evenings."]},"advanced-native-2103-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The loan can be a blessing and a challenge; gratitude does not remove the collection difficulty or prevent discussing it."],"options":["The loan includes delivery to the player, so cross-district collection is not part of the arrangement.","The loan can be a blessing and a challenge; gratitude does not remove the collection difficulty or prevent discussing it.","Mentioning the journey means the player has found no benefit in the loan."]},"advanced-native-2103-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The speaker has decided that the arrangement must end."],"options":["The speaker has decided that the arrangement must end.","Context can identify the benefits and demands.","It has both a valued aspect and a difficult aspect."]},"advanced-native-2103-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It can remain a blessing and a challenge; the equipment is useful, and the overlapping times need a separate agreement."],"options":["I thought recognising the benefit meant neither group could ask for a clearer timetable.","It can remain a blessing and a challenge; the equipment is useful, and the overlapping times need a separate agreement.","I took the timetable problem to mean the groups had already decided to stop sharing the room."]},"advanced-native-2103-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["This first interview has been a blessing and a challenge: I value the stories, but checking the recording has taken longer than I expected. I can send two verified quotations now; could we move the remaining section to next week?","The interview is a blessing and a challenge for me, with rich material and more transcription work than I planned. Here are the two checked quotations; may I agree a new date with you for the rest rather than rush unchecked words into print?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
