('advanced-native-2105', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-2105-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Receiving the cases and checking the inventory required separate people at the same time."],"options":["Mina had already agreed to complete both tasks alone.","The organiser described the move as a task designed for one person.","The inventory check had been removed from the move.","Receiving the cases and checking the inventory required separate people at the same time."]},"advanced-native-2105-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Two simultaneous duties were divided between team members.","The team recognised a practical reason to share the tasks.","It was not a one-person job because receiving and checking needed separate roles.","The work needed agreed help rather than being left entirely to Mina."],"options":["Two simultaneous duties were divided between team members.","The team recognised a practical reason to share the tasks.","It was not a one-person job because receiving and checking needed separate roles.","The work needed agreed help rather than being left entirely to Mina."]},"advanced-native-2105-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Calling it a one-person job describes work for one person here; it does not mean the task is too large for one person."],"options":["The phrase itself means that at least two people must do the printing.","The account says the organiser rejected the one-person arrangement.","Calling it a one-person job describes work for one person here; it does not mean the task is too large for one person."]},"advanced-native-2105-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The move is not a one-person job."],"options":["The label task is a one-person job.","We are checking whether it is a one-person job.","The move is not a one-person job."]},"advanced-native-2105-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It is not a one-person job because the duties overlap in time, not because the phrase judges Mina’s ability; we need an agreed division of roles."],